# Exact decoding of the second Fi22 generator

The explicit character list is identified with the original ATLAS string by
`String.toList_ofList`. The exposed splitter then certifies every parsed cycle
by kernel reduction, using the same method as `InvolutionBlock0`–`5`.
Source: ATLAS F22G1-p3510B0, retained alongside `Fi22.lean`.
-/

